# The App Store screenshot set is a separate design follow-up and does not ship
# in this PR. Iterative composition fixes kept regressing decisions that had
# already been approved, so the set needs one deliberate design pass; two
# blockers are still open (screen 06 shows a disabled CTA, screen 02 is
# off-message against its headline).
#
# The renderer, its sources and its outputs are kept out of git here because the
# outputs and the contact sheet are derived artifacts and the set is unfinished.
# They are preserved in the authoring worktree alongside a
# screenshot-follow-up-notes.md that carries the full history; that notes file is
# ignored by this same list, so it travels with the working copy rather than the
# repository. Delete the entries below to bring any of this back under version
# control.

render-screenshots.mjs
screenshot-sources/
screenshots/
qa/
screenshot-follow-up-notes.md
